The '''2022 Rochford District Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Rochford District Council]] in England. This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.rochford.gov.uk/council-and-democracy/elections/election-results |title=District Election Results |access-date=9 May 2022 |work=Rochford District Council}}</ref>

